
>> santaLaugh := ['ho'].
>> laugh := [''].
{ laugh := laugh + santaLaugh. } × 3.
Imveliso bhala: laugh, umgca-omtsha.

>> locked := Ubuxoki.
>> security := Inyaniso.
security inyaniso: { locked := Inyaniso. }.
Imveliso bhala: locked, umgca-omtsha.

>> n := 7.
(Inyaniso) inyaniso: { n := 9. }.
Imveliso bhala: n.
